{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"kanagawa-wave","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.0.0","displayName":"Kanagawa Wave","description":"Muted colors inspired by the famous wave painting.","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Themes"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"themes":[{"label":"Kanagawa Wave","path":"themes/kanagawa-wave.json","uiTheme":"dark"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"themes/kanagawa-wave.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"name\": \"Kanagawa Wave\",\n  \"type\": \"dark\",\n  \"colors\": {\n    \"editor.background\": \"#1f1f28\",\n    \"editor.foreground\": \"#dcd7ba\",\n    \"sideBar.background\": \"#1a1a22\",\n    \"activityBar.background\": \"#16161d\",\n    \"titleBar.activeBackground\": \"#16161d\",\n    \"tab.inactiveBackground\": \"#1a1a22\",\n    \"list.hoverBackground\": \"#2a2a37\",\n    \"list.activeSelectionBackground\": \"#2d4f67\",\n    \"input.background\": \"#2a2a37\",\n    \"editorWidget.background\": \"#1a1a22\",\n    \"panel.border\": \"#16161d\",\n    \"focusBorder\": \"#7e9cd8\",\n    \"button.background\": \"#7e9cd8\",\n    \"textLink.foreground\": \"#7e9cd8\",\n    \"editor.selectionBackground\": \"#2d4f67\",\n    \"editor.lineHighlightBackground\": \"#2a2a3780\",\n    \"editorCursor.foreground\": \"#7e9cd8\",\n    \"editorIndentGuide.background\": \"#16161d\",\n    \"errorForeground\": \"#e82424\",\n    \"gitDecoration.addedResourceForeground\": \"#76946a\",\n    \"gitDecoration.modifiedResourceForeground\": \"#c0a36e\",\n    \"gitDecoration.deletedResourceForeground\": \"#c34043\"\n  },\n  \"tokenColors\": [\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"comment\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#727169\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"string\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#98bb6c\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"constant.numeric\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#d27e99\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"keyword\",\n        \"storage\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#957fb8\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.name.type\",\n        \"support.type\",\n        \"storage.type\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#7aa89f\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.name.function\",\n        \"support.function\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#7e9cd8\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"constant.language\",\n        \"constant\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#ffa066\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"variable.other.property\",\n        \"support.type.property-name\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#e6c384\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.name.tag\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#e46876\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.other.attribute-name\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#e6c384\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.name.function.macro\",\n        \"meta.preprocessor\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#ff5d62\"\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# Kanagawa Wave\n\nMuted colors inspired by the famous wave painting.\n\nInstall it, then pick **Kanagawa Wave** in **Settings > Colour theme**. It is a dark theme.\n\nInspired by the Kanagawa palette by rebelot (MIT).\n\n| Role | Color |\n| --- | --- |\n| Background | `#1f1f28` |\n| Text | `#dcd7ba` |\n| Accent | `#7e9cd8` |\n| Keywords | `#957fb8` |\n| Strings | `#98bb6c` |\n| Functions | `#7e9cd8` |\n| Types | `#7aa89f` |\n| Comments | `#727169` |\n\nThis extension is only a theme: it runs no code and asks for no permissions.\n"}}}